The new project has everything it takes to spark user interest — assuming, of course, you enjoy games where exploring the world involves unraveling various secrets, all wrapped up in an engaging storyline and featuring superbly realized game locations.

Some features:
- Kidnapped by an unknown person, your hero finds himself in a mysterious and enigmatic world, which he must actually explore;
- Unreal Engine 4, one of the modern and best engines for bringing everything the creators have conceived, is responsible for the quality of the image, sound, detail and effects;
